  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f867e729cd163844296773769e23f97f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lionel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 1
  m_Description: "Lionel, 12th prince of the Empire, stands as a radiant prodigy
    forged in a dynasty where only excellence is permitted to survive. Raised among
    brothers who shine like polished steel, he learned from childhood that greatness
    is not bestowed by birthright\u2014it is seized, honed, and earned. And Lionel
    has vowed, silently yet fiercely, to rise above them all.\n\nBlessed by the Holy
    Sun Church, he kneels as often as he fights. His armor, emblazoned with golden
    crosses, gleams like dawn within cathedral halls, and the devout revere him as
    the living ideal of their faith. The Saint Seat itself entrusted him with Judgement
    Bringer, a sacred blade said to channel the Sun God\u2019s flame. In Lionel\u2019s
    hands, its crimson edge ignites with righteous fire, turning his disciplined
    swordsmanship into a blazing spectacle that once shook even the grand arena of
    the capital\u2014where he earned fame despite his youth.\n\nOutwardly, he is
    cherished by nobles and celebrated by common folk, though he rarely walks among
    them. His reputation\u2014untarnished, immaculate\u2014is the kind of legend
    that precedes the man. Yet within him burns a desire far more human, far more
    dangerous: the yearning to prove himself worthy of the throne, to carve a legacy
    so brilliant that history itself will bow before it. He never voices that ambition,
    but it shapes every dawn he greets with relentless training, every prayer he
    whispers beneath stained-glass light, every oath he swears in the Sun God\u2019s
    name.\n\nResolute, pious, and unwaveringly just, Lionel stands on the cusp of
    legend\u2014not for what he has accomplished, but for the greatness he is determined
    to seize. And should the Empire one day tremble, it may well be the fire in his
    heart, rather than the sun in the sky, that lights the path forward."
  m_SpellElements: 02000000
